			"notes": "## VillageCraft Professions Mod v1.0.0\n\n### Features\n- 40+ professions with advancement tree\n- Interlocking crafting dependencies\n- Custom villager trades\n- 87 advancement items\n- 44 crafting recipes\n- Complete Fabric 1.20.1 implementation\n\n### Installation\n1. Install Fabric Loader for MC 1.20.1 from https://fabricmc.net/use\n2. Install Fabric API 0.91.0+ from https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\n3. Drop JAR into mods/ folder\n\n### Quick Start\n- Craft Profession Token (Iron + Emerald + Paper in crafting table)\n- Give to unemployed villager → becomes Worker\n- Level villager to 3 through trading\n- Give advancement item → profession advances\n\n### Profession Trees\n- **Combat:** Tradesman → Brawler → Knight/Captain/etc.\n- **Economy:** Worker → Merchant → Mayor/Diplomat\n- **Crafting:** Worker → Blacksmith → Engineer\n- **Agriculture:** Worker → Farmer → Herbalist/Bee Keeper\n\n### Note\nItems will show placeholder textures (purple/black checkerboard) - functionality is complete, needs texture PNG assets for visuals.\n\n### Links\n- Repository: https://github.com/WembassyCo/villagecraft-professions\n- Issues: https://github.com/WembassyCo/villagecraft-professions/issues"
		}
